    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="36500696-e6fe-5933-8959-04a9cc4b64ea" activityNameId="b99f804e-40e4-549a-9282-55bc257465d1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transistor, wired, big size, through-hole mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transistor, wired, big size, through-hole mounting, at plant
The data represent a typical wired, big-sized, transistor for through-hole mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such transistors. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of transistors with a weight of 6.34 gram/unit.; UUID: 39d634a7-2551-303e-9acb-bebc166d1097
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used biz-sized wired transistors for through-hole mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of big wired transistors.
Technology: average production technology comprising Si-crystal die bonding; wire bonding; encapsulation; plating; triming; forming and marking.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature and estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_39d634a7-2551-303e-9acb-bebc166d1097.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
